job_description:
Position: Visual Designer (Acme Studio)
Responsibilities:
1. Design posters and collateral for brand projects;
2. Prepare assets and layouts for design proposals;
3. Revise drafts based on feedback and deliver on time;
4. Maintain the asset library and design guidelines.
Requirements:
1. Degree in design or related field;
2. Proficient with mainstream design tools;
3. A complete portfolio is required;
4. Brand or e-commerce project experience preferred.
